        <item>
            <title>1.0.44</title>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>
<strong>Beta release</strong> — please send feedback from Help › Send Feedback.
</p>
<h3>Bug fixes</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Pasting into an email works again.</strong> Text and tables copied from other emails no longer paste in as invisible text in dark mode — they keep their layout and match your message's colors.</li>
<li><strong>Undo after pasting.</strong> ⌘Z now undoes a paste.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
