        <item>
            <title>1.0.42</title>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>
<strong>Beta release</strong> — please send feedback from Help › Send Feedback.
</p>
<h3>What's new</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Subscriptions.</strong> See every newsletter and mailing list you can unsubscribe from, one row per sender — ten emails from the same newsletter show up once, with a count. Unsubscribe in one click, or archive everything from that sender. Open it from the sidebar or View › Subscriptions (⌥⌘U).</li>
</ul>]]></description>
